msgstr "A noisy scavenger. It goes off for fish and brings it back: it heals 8 % health and sanity (up to 15 %) to whoever needs it most. It screeches when it spots an elite"

#: data/pets/gaviota.tres
msgid "Gaviota de Innsmouth"
msgstr "Innsmouth gull"

#: data/pets/migo.tres
